<title>UK: Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs up three at 64 in week.</title>
<headline>Northwest Europe oil, gas rigs up three at 64 in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs operating offshore Northwest Europe totalled 64 in the week ending July 9, up three from the previous week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>There were 32 rigs operating in British waters, up two from the previous week. Norway, the Netherlands and Denmark were unchanged at 17, 10 and three respectively. Ireland was up one at two rigs.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
